  <diagram id="aBKUSEoDJ_cfjxy6UJFV" name="Sequence Diagram">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2357" dy="1402" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    box rgba(120,170,255,0.15) Customer Channel - Untrusted\n        actor User as Người dùng\n        participant FE as Frontend App\n    end\n    box rgba(150,220,150,0.15) SCEX - Internal Zone\n        participant Core as [SVC] Core Backend\n        participant COM as [SVC] Conditional Order Manager\n        participant ME as [SVC] Matching Engine\n        participant MDS as [SVC] Market Data Service\n        participant Bal as [SVC] Balance System\n    end\n    box rgba(180,180,180,0.12) Data and Messaging\n        participant DB as [DB] Order DB\n        participant Kafka as [MQ] Kafka Broker\n    end\n\n    rect rgba(120,170,255,0.08)\n    Note over User,DB: Giai đoạn 1 – Nhập và validate\n    User-&gt;&gt;FE: 1.1 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Nhập thông tin lệnh&lt;br&gt;(side, qty, price, stop_price, limit_price)\n    FE-&gt;&gt;FE: 1.2 [Internal]&lt;br&gt;Validate client-side&lt;br&gt;(tick, step, min size, số dư, hạn mức)\n    FE--&gt;&gt;User: 1.3 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Popup xác nhận lệnh\n    User-&gt;&gt;FE: 1.4 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Ấn Xác nhận\n    FE-&gt;&gt;Core: 1.5 [POST/REST]&lt;br&gt;/orders&lt;br&gt;(CreateOrderReq)\n    Core-&gt;&gt;Core: 1.6 [Internal]&lt;br&gt;Validate order rules\n    break [E] Validation fail\n        Core--&gt;&gt;FE: 1.6E [400]&lt;br&gt;ValidationError hoặc 429\n        FE--&gt;&gt;User: 1.6E.1 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Hiển thị thông báo lỗi\n    end\n    end\n\n    rect rgba(255,180,80,0.08)\n    Note over Core,Kafka: Giai đoạn 2 – Tạo lệnh và khoá số dư\n    Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 2.1 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;INSERT INTO orders&lt;br&gt;(pending hoặc active/waiting)\n    Core--&gt;&gt;FE: 2.2 [200 OK]&lt;br&gt;OrderCreatedResp&lt;br&gt;(order_id)\n    FE--&gt;&gt;User: 2.3 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Tab Lệnh mở hoặc Lệnh chờ\n    Core-)Kafka: 2.4 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish LockBalanceEvent&lt;br&gt;(user_id, amount)\n    Kafka--&gt;&gt;Bal: 2.5 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;LockBalanceEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: balance)\n    Bal-)Kafka: 2.6 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish BalanceLockedEvent&lt;br&gt;(order_id, result)\n    Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 2.7 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;BalanceLockedEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n    break [E] Lock fail\n        Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 2.8E [SQL]&lt;br&gt;UPDATE orders SET status=failed\n        Core--)FE: 2.8E.1 [WSS]&lt;br&gt;ORDER_FAILED&lt;br&gt;(order_id, status)\n        FE--&gt;&gt;User: 2.8E.2 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Hiển thị thông báo lỗi\n    end\n    end\n\n    rect rgba(150,220,150,0.08)\n    Note over Core,ME: Giai đoạn 3 – Cổng vào Matching Engine\n    alt Lệnh thường limit hoặc market\n        Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 3.1a.1 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;UPDATE orders SET status=live\n        Core-&gt;&gt;ME: 3.1a.2 [Internal]&lt;br&gt;Submit order to Matching Engine&lt;br&gt;(order_id, type, side, qty, price)\n    else Lệnh điều kiện stop_limit hoặc stop_market\n        Core-&gt;&gt;COM: 3.1b.1 [Internal]&lt;br&gt;Register stop watch&lt;br&gt;(order_id, stop_price, condition)\n        Note over COM,MDS: Kênh last price đã mở (mục 1)\n        loop [LOOP] Chờ Last Price chạm Stop Price\n            MDS--&gt;&gt;COM: 3.1b.2 [WSS/Internal]&lt;br&gt;Last price updates\n            Note over COM: Có thể huỷ theo luồng 2.4 trước khi trigger\n        end\n        COM-&gt;&gt;COM: 3.1b.3 [Internal]&lt;br&gt;TriggerOrderEvent&lt;br&gt;(order_id)\n        COM-)Kafka: 3.1b.4 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish child Limit hoặc Market order event&lt;br&gt;(order_id, child_type)\n        Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 3.1b.5 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Child order event&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n        Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 3.1b.6 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;UPDATE trigger_status=triggered, status=live\n        Kafka--&gt;&gt;ME: 3.1b.7 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Child order event&lt;br&gt;(group: matching-engine)\n    end\n    end\n\n    rect rgba(255,200,120,0.08)\n    Note over ME,Bal: Giai đoạn 4 – Khớp lệnh\n    alt Hành vi Limit (limit và lệnh con stop_limit)\n        Note over ME: Taker khớp ngay phần có thể - phần còn lại Maker trên orderbook - số dư phần chờ giữ khoá\n        loop [LOOP] Mỗi TradeEvent\n            ME-)Kafka: 4.1a.1 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish TradeEvent&lt;br&gt;(trades, qty, price)\n            Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 4.1a.2 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;TradeEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n            Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 4.1a.3 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;INSERT trades / UPDATE raw&lt;br&gt;partial_filled (display live)&lt;br&gt;hoặc executed (display live)\n        end\n    else Hành vi Market (market và lệnh con stop_market)\n        Note over ME: Khớp ngay giá tốt nhất - tối đa 100.000 Limit đối ứng - dừng khi trượt quá ngưỡng\n        alt Khớp toàn bộ\n            ME-)Kafka: 4.1b.1 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish TradeEvent&lt;br&gt;(qty khớp đủ)\n            Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 4.1b.2 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;TradeEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n            Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 4.1b.3 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;INSERT trades / UPDATE raw=executed&lt;br&gt;(display live)\n        else Khớp một phần NOT_ENOUGH_LIQUIDITY hoặc SLIPPAGE_REACHED qty lớn hơn 0\n            ME-)Kafka: 4.1b.4 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish TradeEvent + MarketOrderExecuted&lt;br&gt;(stop_type)\n            Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 4.1b.5 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;TradeEvent + MarketOrderExecuted&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n            Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 4.1b.6 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;INSERT trades / UPDATE raw=executed&lt;br&gt;(display live) - không ghi cancelled\n        else Không khớp execute_failed\n            ME-)Kafka: 4.1b.7 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish MarketOrderExecuted&lt;br&gt;(execute_failed)\n            Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 4.1b.8 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;MarketOrderExecuted&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n            Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 4.1b.9 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;UPDATE raw=execute_failed&lt;br&gt;(display failed)\n        end\n    end\n    end\n\n    rect rgba(200,180,255,0.08)\n    Note over Core,Bal: Giai đoạn 4.2 – Settlement (Balance = source of truth)&lt;br&gt;ref: debit/credit phần đã khớp, unlock phần chưa khớp, fee/tax US.04 ngoài phạm vi\n    Core-)Kafka: 4.2.1 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish TradeSettlementRequestedEvent&lt;br&gt;(order_id, trades, remaining_unlock?)\n    Kafka--&gt;&gt;Bal: 4.2.2 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;TradeSettlementRequestedEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: balance)\n    Bal-)Kafka: 4.2.3 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;Publish TradeSettlementCompletedEvent&lt;br&gt;(order_id, result)\n    Kafka--&gt;&gt;Core: 4.2.4 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;TradeSettlementCompletedEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: core-order)\n    Core-&gt;&gt;DB: 4.2.5 [SQL]&lt;br&gt;UPDATE sau settle OK&lt;br&gt;Market full/0-fill → cancelled_fund_settled (display cancelled)&lt;br&gt;Market partial → partial_filled_fund_settled (display partial_filled)&lt;br&gt;Limit còn trên sổ: settle trade legs, raw giữ partial_filled (display live)\n    end\n\n    rect rgba(180,180,255,0.08)\n    Note over MDS,User: Giai đoạn 5 – Cập nhật realtime\n    Kafka--&gt;&gt;MDS: 5.1 [Kafka]&lt;br&gt;TradeEvent&lt;br&gt;(group: market-data)\n    MDS--)FE: 5.2 [WSS]&lt;br&gt;MARKET_DATA_UPDATE&lt;br&gt;(last_price, recent_trades, orderbook)\n    Core--)FE: 5.3 [WSS]&lt;br&gt;ORDER_STATUS_UPDATE&lt;br&gt;(order_id, display status, balance)\n    FE--&gt;&gt;User: 5.4 [UI]&lt;br&gt;Hiển thị trạng thái lệnh và thị trường\n    Note over Core: Khi display cancelled hoặc partial_filled tiếp tục luồng 5 Thông báo trạng thái lệnh\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="udfPt9Nxvkm1605MocCa-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=20;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
